# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:18
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_fa520e80:

    # "As we work on our assignments in English class, Mrs. McGee comes by my desk and leans down to whisper in my ear."
    "Mentre lavoriamo ai compiti durante la lezione di inglese, la signora McGee si avvicina al mio banco e si china per sussurrarmi all’orecchio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:19
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_d9b1882f:

    # et "[pcname], would you stay after class a few moments. There's something I'd like to discuss with you."
    et "[pcname], potresti restare dopo la lezione per qualche minuto? C’è qualcosa di cui vorrei parlarti."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:20
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_1ca80c77:

    # pc "Yes, ma'am."
    pc "Sì, signora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:23
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_cc0f4023:

    # "Wonder what she could want to talk about this time? Whatever it is, I'm excited to find out."
    "Chissà di cosa vorrà parlarmi questa volta? Qualunque cosa sia, non vedo l’ora di scoprirlo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:26
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_6facc3ac:

    # "After the rest of the classroom empties, Mrs. McGee shuts the door and sits on her desk."
    "Dopo che il resto della classe se ne è andato, la signora McGee chiude la porta e si siede sulla cattedra."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:27
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_1e1882e3:

    # et "Would you like to come over to my house for dinner tonight?"
    et "Ti andrebbe di venire a cena a casa mia stasera?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:28
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_9bc190a8:

    # pc "Dinner?"
    pc "A cena?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:29
translate italian mrsmcgee10a_d5ef02f0:

    # et "Yes, if you'd like. I make a very nice kasha. I promise you will have a good time."
    et "Sì, se ti va. Preparo un ottimo kasha. Ti prometto che ti divertirai."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:34
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_ececefc2:

    # et "Good, then I will see you this evening. Say, around 6:30?"
    et "Bene, allora ci vediamo stasera. Diciamo verso le 18:30?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:35
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_36ffe6b6:

    # "She hands me a note with her address on it."
    "Mi porge un biglietto con il suo indirizzo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:36
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_ad15b3ba:

    # pc "I'll be there. Should I bring anything?"
    pc "Ci sarò. Devo portare qualcosa?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:37
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_4ee87fdf:

    # et "Just you. That's all I need."
    et "Solo te stesso. È tutto ciò di cui ho bisogno."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:38
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_696181f3:

    # pc "Okay then, see you tonight."
    pc "Ok allora, ci vediamo stasera."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:39
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_dd6a1a96:

    # et "Goodbye, [pcname]."
    et "Ciao, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:43
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_3f5db218:

    # "I leave her class, looking forward to whatever is going to happen tonight. It definitely seems like she wants more than to just eat dinner with me."
    "Esco dalla sua lezione, impaziente di vedere cosa succederà stasera. Sembra proprio che lei voglia qualcosa di più che cenare semplicemente con me."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:44
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_dc3258ef:

    # "And I want more than that with her too."
    "E anch’io voglio qualcosa di più con lei."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:51
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_eea40836:

    # et "Oh. Maybe some other time then."
    et "Oh. Magari un’altra volta, allora."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:52
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_61f77a4c:

    # pc "Sure."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:53
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_577e28d7:

    # et "Have a good day, [pcname]."
    et "Buona giornata, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:54
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_eb61ef6e:

    # pc "You too."
    pc "Anche a te."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:57
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_b142bee1:

    # "I leave and go on with the rest of my day. I wonder why I turned that down? Maybe I'm not really interested in Mrs. McGee at all."
    "Me ne vado e proseguo con il resto della mia giornata. Mi chiedo perché l’ho rifiutato? Forse non sono affatto interessato alla signora McGee."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:63
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_d4a7d900:

    # et "Oh, it's a type of soup or porridge, with cereal in it."
    et "Oh, è una specie di zuppa o porridge, con dei cereali dentro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:64
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_3d903830:

    # pc "Like Frosted Flakes or something?"
    pc "Tipo i Frosted Flakes o qualcosa del genere?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:65
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_230a666c:

    # et "Um, no... not like Frosted Flakes."
    et "Ehm, no... non come i Frosted Flakes."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:66
translate italian mrsmcgee10menu_a3518e13:

    # et "It's good. You will like it. So what do you think? Will you come?"
    et "È buono. Ti piacerà. Allora, che ne pensi? Verrai?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:76
translate italian mrsmcgee10_a5aa248c:

    # "After I leave work, I drive home, take a quick shower, and change clothes, then head over to the address that Mrs. McGee gave me."
    "Dopo il lavoro, guido fino a casa, faccio una doccia veloce, mi cambio e poi mi dirigo all’indirizzo che mi ha dato la signora McGee."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:79
translate italian mrsmcgee10_c2171e40:

    # "I pull up into the driveway and park. She lives in a small house in the suburbs, much like my own."
    "Entro nel vialetto e parcheggio. Vive in una casetta in periferia, molto simile alla mia."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:80
translate italian mrsmcgee10_c58d627f:

    # "A little nervous about how things are going to go tonight, I take a deep breath, then step out and walk up to the door."
    "Un po’ nervoso per come andranno le cose stasera, faccio un respiro profondo, poi scendo dall’auto e mi avvicino alla porta."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:83
translate italian mrsmcgee10_0b66d801:

    # "When I get to the door, I raise my hand to knock..."
    "Quando arrivo alla porta, alzo la mano per bussare..."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:85
translate italian mrsmcgee10_0a429c3d:

    # "But before my knuckles touch wood, the door swings open and Mr. McGee is standing there with a big smile on his face."
    "Ma prima che le mie nocche tocchino il legno, la porta si spalanca e il signor McGee è lì in piedi con un grande sorriso sul volto."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:86
translate italian mrsmcgee10_bda45b99:

    # mrmg "[pcname]! I'm so glad you came! Come on in!"
    mrmg "[pcname]! Sono così felice che tu sia venuto! Entra pure!"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:89
translate italian mrsmcgee10_f8f82946:

    # "I walk in and stand in the foyer, a little awkward. The place smells amazing - that savory smell of grilled onions with an underhint of bacon."
    "Entro e mi fermo nell’atrio, un po’ a disagio. La casa ha un profumo incredibile: quel profumo saporito di cipolle grigliate con un leggero sentore di pancetta."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:90
translate italian mrsmcgee10_fb665e30:

    # pc "Thank you for inviting me, Mr. McGee."
    pc "Grazie per avermi invitato, signor McGee."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:91
translate italian mrsmcgee10_5ba2ce58:

    # mrmg "Oh that's going to be weird if you keep calling me Mister. Call me Pete, okay?"
    mrmg "Oh, sarà strano se continui a chiamarmi “signor”. Chiamami Pete, ok?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:92
translate italian mrsmcgee10_845da3d6:

    # pc "Alright, Pete."
    pc "Va bene, Pete."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:94
translate italian mrsmcgee10_3561000e:

    # mrmg "I think Edie's done cooking and is in the bedroom getting dressed now, if you want to join me in the dining room, we can wait for her there."
    mrmg "Credo che Edie abbia finito di cucinare e che ora sia in camera a vestirsi; se vuoi raggiungermi in sala da pranzo, possiamo aspettarla lì."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:95
translate italian mrsmcgee10_74dad17c:

    # pc "Okay, sure."
    pc "Ok, certo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:98
translate italian mrsmcgee10_ce18fa39:

    # mrmg "Are you okay? You seem a little nervous."
    mrmg "Stai bene? Sembri un po’ nervoso."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:99
translate italian mrsmcgee10_4c567549:

    # pc "I am... this is a little weird."
    pc "Lo sono... è un po’ strano."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:100
translate italian mrsmcgee10_f000a834:

    # mrmg "It's fine, I promise. We both like you and just wanted to have dinner and talk a bit."
    mrmg "Va tutto bene, te lo prometto. Ci piaci entrambi e volevamo solo cenare insieme e chiacchierare un po’."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:101
translate italian mrsmcgee10_760593d6:

    # mrmg "And we'll just leave it at that if you don't want to take it any further."
    mrmg "E se non vuoi andare oltre, la lasceremo semplicemente così."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:102
translate italian mrsmcgee10_67b4f891:

    # mrmg "At the very least, you'll get some good food. Edie's kasha is amazing."
    mrmg "Come minimo, mangerai bene. Il kasha di Edie è fantastico."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:103
translate italian mrsmcgee10_8e1808a3:

    # pc "Mrs. McGee's name is Edie?"
    pc "La signora McGee si chiama Edie?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:104
translate italian mrsmcgee10_6ed863ba:

    # mrmg "Well, Eden. But I call her Edie."
    mrmg "Beh, Eden. Ma io la chiamo Edie."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:107
translate italian mrsmcgee10_3ea2e3a2:

    # mrmg "There she is, my beautiful wife."
    mrmg "Eccola lì, la mia bellissima moglie."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:108
translate italian mrsmcgee10_ce59dba2:

    # pc "Wow."
    pc "Wow."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:109
translate italian mrsmcgee10_6c592216:

    # et "Hello, boys. Hitting it off in here?"
    et "Ciao, ragazzi. Vi state trovando bene qui?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:110
translate italian mrsmcgee10_11adb751:

    # mrmg "We were just talking about you."
    mrmg "Stavamo proprio parlando di te."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:111
translate italian mrsmcgee10_0b1aa19c:

    # et "Oh yeah? I like that."
    et "Ah sì? Mi fa piacere."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:112
translate italian mrsmcgee10_fb640479:

    # et "I'm glad you made it, [pcname]."
    et "Sono contenta che tu sia venuto, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:113
translate italian mrsmcgee10_c8e5d523:

    # et "Are you two ready to eat?"
    et "Siete pronti a mangiare?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:114
translate italian mrsmcgee10_e9a44191:

    # mrmg "Absolutely. I'm starving."
    mrmg "Assolutamente sì. Sto morendo di fame."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:117
translate italian mrsmcgee10_99840180:

    # "She serves the kasha to us, putting a glass of white wine along with the bowls. Then she surprises me by sitting next to me instead of her husband."
    "Ci serve il kasha, accompagnando le ciotole con un bicchiere di vino bianco. Poi mi sorprende sedendosi accanto a me invece che a suo marito."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:118
translate italian mrsmcgee10_1c875ad0:

    # et "I hope you enjoy. Kasha is one of my specialties."
    et "Spero che vi piaccia. Il kasha è una delle mie specialità."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:119
translate italian mrsmcgee10_d21d1a56:

    # pc "It smells delicious."
    pc "Ha un profumo delizioso."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:122
translate italian mrsmcgee10_938106e2:

    # "I spoon a bite into my mouth, then a few more spoonfuls as well."
    "Ne assaggio un cucchiaio, poi ne mangio ancora qualche altro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:123
translate italian mrsmcgee10_57c039b1:

    # pc "Tastes delicious too. Wow, that's good."
    pc "È anche buonissimo. Wow, è davvero buono."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:124
translate italian mrsmcgee10_c688553f:

    # et "I'm so glad you like it."
    et "Sono così felice che ti piaccia."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:125
translate italian mrsmcgee10_021eca64:

    # mrmg "I've never met anybody who didn't love Edie's cooking. It's one of the many things that she's incredible at."
    mrmg "Non ho mai incontrato nessuno a cui non piacesse la cucina di Edie. È una delle tante cose in cui è incredibile."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:126
translate italian mrsmcgee10_43260e5f:

    # et "You're going to make me blush, honey."
    et "Mi farai arrossire, tesoro."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:127
translate italian mrsmcgee10_da04860f:

    # mrmg "That's okay. You're gorgeous when you blush."
    mrmg "Non fa niente. Sei bellissima quando arrossisci."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:130
translate italian mrsmcgee10_2e788e2b:

    # mrmg "So, [pcname], we'd love to learn a bit more about you. Do you live with your parents?"
    mrmg "Allora, [pcname], ci piacerebbe sapere qualcosa di più su di te. Vivi con i tuoi genitori?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:131
translate italian mrsmcgee10_9f71a1fe:

    # "I spent the next few minutes telling them about my mom's death and my dad going missing, and Lisa and Suzy."
    "Ho passato i minuti successivi a raccontare loro della morte di mia madre, della scomparsa di mio padre, e di Lisa e Suzy."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:134
translate italian mrsmcgee10_52df5a2c:

    # et "I had no idea you were going through all this. And you're still making straight A's in my class."
    et "Non avevo idea che stessi attraversando tutto questo. Eppure continui a prendere solo A nel mio corso."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:135
translate italian mrsmcgee10_6959b302:

    # et "I'm sorry you're having to deal with those things. It sounds like a hard situation."
    et "Mi dispiace che tu debba affrontare queste cose. Sembra una situazione difficile."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:136
translate italian mrsmcgee10_4f633b03:

    # pc "It is, sometimes. But things haven't been all bad. This dinner, for instance."
    pc "A volte lo è. Ma non è andato tutto male. Questa cena, per esempio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:137
translate italian mrsmcgee10_a831879f:

    # et "I'm glad that I could make you feel a little better."
    et "Sono contenta di averti fatto sentire un po’ meglio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:140
translate italian mrsmcgee10_1dd2ecf3:

    # mrmg "Do you have a girlfriend, [pcname]?"
    mrmg "Hai una ragazza, [pcname]?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:143
translate italian mrsmcgee10_ea5b0c28:

    # pc "Yeah, I do."
    pc "Sì, ce l’ho."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:144
translate italian mrsmcgee10_5474e481:

    # mrmg "Are things serious?"
    mrmg "È una cosa seria?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:145
translate italian mrsmcgee10_e01ed414:

    # pc "Pretty serious."
    pc "Piuttosto seria."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:146
translate italian mrsmcgee10_ce8a6513:

    # mrmg "I see."
    mrmg "Capisco."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:149
translate italian mrsmcgee10_7e1bf495:

    # mrmg "Wow, that's hard to believe!"
    mrmg "Wow, è difficile da credere!"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:150
translate italian mrsmcgee10_9d64452a:

    # pc "You think so?"
    pc "Lo pensi davvero?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:151
translate italian mrsmcgee10_e1f479aa:

    # mrmg "I mean, you're kind of a stud! I figured you'd be drowning in college girls."
    mrmg "Insomma, sei un vero rubacuori! Pensavo che saresti stato sommerso dalle ragazze del college."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:152
translate italian mrsmcgee10_29fc5af6:

    # pc "Yeah, not so much."
    pc "Sì, non proprio."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:153
translate italian mrsmcgee10_f29811da:

    # mrmg "Well, you definitely caught Edie's attention at least."
    mrmg "Beh, almeno hai sicuramente attirato l’attenzione di Edie."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:155
translate italian mrsmcgee10_d867934a:

    # mrmg "Ha! That's what I figured."
    mrmg "Ah! È proprio quello che pensavo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:156
translate italian mrsmcgee10_c7cf6fcb:

    # mrmg "You're kind of a stud! I knew you'd be drowning in college girls."
    mrmg "Sei proprio un figo! Sapevo che saresti stato sommerso dalle ragazze del college."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:157
translate italian mrsmcgee10_64d17d06:

    # mrmg "You definitely caught Edie's attention."
    mrmg "Hai sicuramente attirato l’attenzione di Edie."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:160
translate italian mrsmcgee10_6ef17689:

    # "We chit chat a bit more while we finish our bowls. I eat every last drop."
    "Chiacchieriamo ancora un po’ mentre finiamo le nostre ciotole. Mangio fino all’ultima goccia."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:161
translate italian mrsmcgee10_668c4331:

    # et "Did you get enough, dear?"
    et "Ne hai avuto abbastanza, cara?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:162
translate italian mrsmcgee10_b4599cf5:

    # "It takes me a moment to realize that she's asking me, not her husband."
    "Mi ci vuole un attimo per capire che sta chiedendo a me, non a suo marito."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:163
translate italian mrsmcgee10_b4bade14:

    # pc "Oh yes, Mrs. McGee, thank you."
    pc "Oh sì, signora McGee, grazie."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:164
translate italian mrsmcgee10_9d8d8515:

    # et "Call me Eden, please."
    et "Chiamami Eden, per favore."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:165
translate italian mrsmcgee10_180bb07c:

    # pc "Okay, Eden."
    pc "Va bene, Eden."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:170
translate italian mrsmcgee10_76f15013:

    # mrmg "I guess we should talk about the second reason we invited you over tonight, besides the food."
    mrmg "Credo che dovremmo parlare del secondo motivo per cui ti abbiamo invitata qui stasera, oltre al cibo."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:171
translate italian mrsmcgee10_e18be8a3:

    # mrmg "My wife likes you, [pcname]. Since the beginning of the school year, you're all she talks about."
    mrmg "A mia moglie piaci, [pcname]. Dall’inizio dell’anno scolastico non fa altro che parlare di te."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:172
translate italian mrsmcgee10_b3c66524:

    # mrmg "She lies in bed at night and tells me how much she wants to have sex with you."
    mrmg "Di notte, a letto, mi dice quanto vorrebbe fare sesso con te."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:175
translate italian mrsmcgee10_399bdc0f:

    # pc "Really?"
    pc "Davvero?"

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:176
translate italian mrsmcgee10_9880f614:

    # et "Yes."
    et "Sì."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:179
translate italian mrsmcgee10_546d48e6:

    # mrmg "My wife and I love each other very much. We are extremely happy in our relationship."
    mrmg "Io e mia moglie ci amiamo moltissimo. Siamo estremamente felici nella nostra relazione."

# game/Scenes/MrsMcGee/mrsmcgee10.rpy:180
